{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NujX3AtXfHcFkqEjzxfRst","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have a complete picture. Let me create a comprehensive summary report:\n\n## Comprehensive Tank-Simulation Project Exploration Report\n\n### 1. TANK_TUI CRATE\n\n**Current Status:** Minimal implementation with basic structure in place.\n\n**Source Files:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/src/lib.rs` (36 lines)\n\n**What Exists:**\n- `Screen` enum with 5 screens: `Overview`, `Chemistry`, `Biology`, `Actions`, `Log`\n- `TuiApp` struct with:\n  - `active_screen: Screen`\n  - `snapshot: TankSnapshot`\n  - `pending_actions: Vec<PlayerAction>`\n  - Methods: `new()`, `queue_action()`, `update_snapshot()`\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- `crossterm` (0.27) - Terminal control\n- `ratatui` (0.26) - TUI framework\n- `tank_core` - Local crate dependency\n\n**What's Missing:**\n- No actual screen rendering implementations\n- No event handlers or input processing\n- No widgets or UI layout logic\n- No main binary or entry point\n\n---\n\n### 2. TANK_SCENARIOS CRATE\n\n**Current Status:** Functional with scenario materialization and fixture pair generation.\n\n**Source Files:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` (352 lines)\n\n**What Exists:**\n\n**Public Functions:**\n1. `default_scenario_ids()` - Returns `&['nano_cycle', 'medium_planted', 'warm_room']`\n2. `load_named_scenario(id)` - Loads ScenarioPreset from tank_data\n3. `seeded_state(seed, scenario_id)` - Materializes a fully resolved TankState from scenario preset\n4. `cycling_fixture_pair(seed)` - Creates paired seeded/unseeded fixture states for nitrogen cycling tests\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Converts tank_data presets into tank_core types\n- Populates source-water catalog with all known presets\n- Handles substrate layer creation and initialization\n- Initializes plant guilds from presets\n- Sets up environment state from scenario\n- Creates deterministic cycling fixtures with different initial microbe states\n\n**Test File:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/tests/materialization.rs` (147 lines)\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n1. `nano_cycle_materializes_correctly` - Geometry, volume, metadata, water catalog, substrate, plants\n2. `medium_planted_materializes_with_two_substrates_and_plants` - Multi-substrate/plant scenarios\n3. `warm_room_materializes_with_high_ambient` - High-ambient scenario\n4. `deterministic_materialization` - Same seed produces identical states\n5. `unknown_scenario_returns_error` - Error handling\n6. `cycling_fixtures_are_deterministic_and_differ_in_seeding` - Fixture pair validation\n\n---\n\n### 3. ACCEPTANCE TESTS INVENTORY\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/tests/`\n\n**Test Files and Coverage:**\n\n#### determinism.rs (16 lines)\n- `determinism_basic` - Two engines with same seed produce identical snapshots and states\n\n#### save_load.rs (156 lines)\n- `save_load_roundtrip` - SaveFile serialization/deserialization with actions\n- `save_load_with_source_water_catalog` - Source water catalog preservation\n- **save_load_resume_determinism** - MANDATORY: Save after 240h, load, run 480h = uninterrupted 720h\n- `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` - Active nitrogen cycle state preservation\n\n#### water_change_mass_balance.rs (323 lines)\n- **water_change_50_percent_ro_like_halves_dissolved_totals** - MANDATORY: 50% water change halves all dissolved totals (±0.5%)\n- `water_change_0_percent_is_noop` - 0% change no-op verification\n- `water_change_100_percent_yields_source_temperature` - 100% change results in source temperature\n- `water_change_50_percent_mixes_temperature` - Temperature mixing verification\n- `unknown_source_profile_returns_error` - Error handling for unknown profiles\n- `unknown_profile_leaves_state_unchanged` - Rollback on error\n- `invalid_resolved_profile_returns_error_and_leaves_state_unchanged` - Corruption detection\n- `invalid_resolved_profile_negative_chemistry_returns_error` - Negative chemistry validation\n\n#### tank_size_thermal_response.rs (198 lines)\n- **smaller_tank_responds_faster_to_ambient_change** - MANDATORY: 10L reaches half-delta in fewer than half the ticks of 100L\n- `lid_slows_surface_heat_exchange` - Lid effect on heat exchange\n- `feed_pulse_tan_concentration_scales_with_volume` - TAN concentration inversely proportional to volume\n\n#### ambient_temperature_action.rs (142 lines)\n- **ambient_change_causes_gradual_warming** - MANDATORY: Ambient change doesn't instantly transfer to water\n- `do_saturation_decreases_with_warming` - DO saturation decreases with temperature\n- `heater_output_zero_when_above_setpoint` - Heater control logic\n- `heater_never_cools_tank` - Heater never outputs below setpoint\n- `heater_fires_when_below_setpoint` - Heater fires when needed\n\n#### cycling.rs (374 lines)\n- **cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded** - MANDATORY: Seeded tank cycles faster and reaches stable state earlier\n- `filter_cleaning_setback` - CleanFilter action reduces nitrifier biomass\n- `limiter_correctness_no_negative_pools` - Extreme stress test for negative pool prevention\n- `limiter_shared_do_budget` - DO budget enforcement for nitrification\n- `limiter_low_alkalinity_caps_nitrification` - Alkalinity budget enforcement\n- `dirty_filter_slows_nitrification` - Clogged filter reduces nitrification rate\n- `siphon_detritus_reduces_cycling_pressure` - SiphonDetritus action reduces detritus accumulation\n\n#### rooted_substrate_advantage.rs (82 lines)\n- **rooted_substrate_advantage** - MANDATORY: Root-feeding rosette on active_planted substrate grows ≥15% more than on inert_sand\n\n#### thermal_reproduction_penalty.rs (125 lines)\n- **thermal_reproduction_penalty** - MANDATORY: 30°C tank shows ≥20% lower reproductive readiness after 60 days, fewer juveniles\n\n#### events.rs (273 lines)\n- **event_generation_warm_overfed_weak_aeration** - MANDATORY: Warm, overfed, weak-aeration setup emits AmmoniaWarning or OxygenDip\n- `threshold_events_emit_with_cause_codes` - Events include cause codes\n- `threshold_events_are_deduplicated_per_day` - Daily deduplication\n- `shrimp_berried_event_has_cause_codes` - ShrimpBerried events have cause codes\n- `egg_failure_event_has_cause_codes` - EggFailure events have cause codes\n- `molt_stress_warning_has_cause_codes` - MoltStressWarning events have cause codes\n\n**Mandatory Tests Found: 10/10**\n1. ✓ determinism_same_seed → `determinism_basic`\n2. ✓ save_load_resume → `save_load_resume_determinism`\n3. ✓ water_change_mass_balance → `water_change_50_percent_ro_like_halves_dissolved_totals`\n4. ✓ tank_size_response → `smaller_tank_responds_faster_to_ambient_change`\n5. ✓ ambient_temperature_action → `ambient_change_causes_gradual_warming`\n6. ✓ cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded → `cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded`\n7. ✓ overfeeding_effects → `event_generation_warm_overfed_weak_aeration`\n8. ✓ rooted_substrate_advantage → `rooted_substrate_advantage`\n9. ✓ thermal_reproduction_penalty → `thermal_reproduction_penalty`\n10. ✓ event_generation → `threshold_events_emit_with_cause_codes` + others\n\n---\n\n### 4. TANKSNAPSHOT STRUCTURE\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` (129 lines)\n\n**Fields Exposed (42 total):**\n\nTime:\n- `day: u32`\n- `hour: u8`\n\nWater Chemistry:\n- `water_temp_c: f64`\n- `water_volume_l: f64`\n- `tan_mg_l: f64` (total ammonia nitrogen per liter)\n- `nh3_mg_l: f64` (unionized ammonia)\n- `nitrite_mg_l: f64`\n- `nitrate_mg_l: f64`\n- `phosphate_mg_l: f64`\n- `do_mg_l: f64` (dissolved oxygen)\n- `do_sat_mg_l: f64` (DO saturation at current temp)\n- `gh_d: f64` (general hardness in dGH)\n- `kh_d: f64` (carbonate hardness in dKH)\n- `tds_mg_l: f64` (total dissolved solids)\n- `conductivity_us_cm: f64`\n- `ph: f64`\n\nAnimal Populations:\n- `adult_shrimp_count: u32`\n- `juveniles_count: u32`\n- `berried_females_count: u32`\n\nAnimal Condition:\n- `shrimp_condition_index: f64`\n- `shrimp_molt_stress_index: f64`\n- `shrimp_reproductive_readiness: f64`\n\nBiology:\n- `microfauna_population_index: f64`\n- `microfauna_grazing_pressure_index: f64`\n- `total_plant_biomass_g: f64`\n- `fast_stem_biomass_g: f64`\n- `root_feeding_rosette_biomass_g: f64`\n- `suspended_algae_biomass_g: f64`\n- `periphyton_biomass_g: f64`\n- `algae_nuisance_index: f64`\n\nSubstrate:\n- `substrate_nutrient_remaining_mg_n_total: f64`\n- `substrate_nutrient_remaining_mg_p_total: f64`\n\nHardware:\n- `last_heater_output_w: f64`\n\nEvents:\n- `recent_events: Vec<SimEvent>` (last 20 events, reversed)\n\n---\n\n### 5. PLAYERACTION VARIANTS\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` (180 lines)\n\n**Implemented Variants (11 total):**\n\n1. **Feed** `{ grams: f64 }`\n2. **WaterChangePercent** `{ percent: f64, source_profile_id: String }`\n3. **TrimPlants** `{ fraction: f64 }`\n4. **SiphonDetritus** `{ fraction: f64 }`\n5. **CleanFilter** `{ intensity: f64 }`\n6. **AddShrimp** `{ count: u32 }`\n7. **RemoveShrimp** `{ count: u32 }`\n8. **ChangePhotoperiod** `{ hours: f64 }`\n9. **ChangeLightIntensity** `{ intensity_index: f64 }`\n10. **ChangeHeaterSetpoint** `{ setpoint_c: f64 }`\n11. **ChangeAmbientTemperature** `{ target_c: f64 }`\n12. **ChangeAeration** `{ enabled: bool, intensity: f64 }`\n\n**Validation Implemented:**\n- Non-negative (Feed, grams)\n- Percent range (0-100)\n- Fraction range (0-1)\n- Hours range (0-24)\n- Temperature > 0°C\n- Finite values\n- Non-empty source_profile_id\n- Shrimp removal doesn't exceed available\n\n---\n\n### 6. EVENT KINDS\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/events.rs` (78 lines)\n\n**EventKind Enum (13 variants):**\n1. `CycleProgressing`\n2. `AmmoniaWarning`\n3. `NitriteWarning`\n4. `OxygenDip`\n5. `AlgaeRiskRising`\n6. `AlgaeBloom`\n7. `BiofilmMaturityIncrease`\n8. `ShrimpBerried`\n9. `EggFailure`\n10. `MoltStressWarning`\n11. `FilterCleaningSetback`\n12. `SubstrateFoulingWarning`\n13. `StabilityImproving`\n\n**EventCause Enum (17 variants):**\n- `RoutineAction`, `Overfeeding`, `WaterChange`, `FilterMaintenance`\n- `HighAmmonia`, `HighNitrite`, `LowOxygen`, `HighTemperature`, `LowMinerals`\n- `BiofilterImmature`, `SurfaceExchangeRestricted`, `HighNutrients`, `PlantCrowding`\n- `SurfaceSaturation`, `SubstrateExhausted`, `ChemistryInstability`, `Starvation`, `PoorCondition`\n\n**EventSeverity Enum (3 variants):**\n- `Info`, `Warning`, `Critical`\n\n**SimEvent Structure:**\n- `day: u32`, `hour: u8`\n- `severity: EventSeverity`\n- `kind: EventKind`\n- `cause_codes: Vec<EventCause>`\n- `summary: String`\n\n---\n\n### 7. TOML PRESET FILES\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/`\n\n**Scenarios (3):**\n1. `nano_cycle.toml` - 30×20cm, 10.8L, 24°C ambient, soft_acidic water, inert_sand, fast_stem\n2. `medium_planted.toml` - 60×30cm, ~57.6L, 24°C ambient, moderate water, active_planted + coarse_porous, fast_stem + root_rosette\n3. `warm_room.toml` - 45×24cm, ~25.9L, 29°C ambient, moderate water, inert_gravel, fast_stem\n\n**Source Water (4):**\n1. `soft_acidic.toml` - 23°C, GH ~3.0, KH ~1.5, TDS ~90, DIC 6.0 mg/L\n2. `moderate.toml` - 24°C, GH ~6.0, KH ~3.5, TDS ~160, DIC 15.0 mg/L, 5 mg/L NO3\n3. `hard_shrimp.toml` - 23°C, GH ~9.3, KH ~5.0, TDS ~220, DIC 21.0 mg/L, 8 mg/L NO3\n4. `ro_like.toml` - 23°C, All zeros (pure deionized for regression tests)\n\n**Substrates (4):**\n1. `inert_sand.toml` - 3cm depth, CEC 0.1, no nutrient charge, low detritus trapping\n2. `inert_gravel.toml` - 4cm depth, CEC 0.1, no nutrient charge, very low detritus trapping\n3. `active_planted.toml` - 5cm depth, CEC 0.9, 60mg N + 18mg P nutrients, high detritus trapping\n4. `coarse_porous.toml` - 4cm depth, CEC 0.3, 10mg N + 3mg P nutrients, very high detritus trapping\n\n**Plants (2):**\n1. `fast_stem.toml` - FastStem guild, 0.9 growth rate, 0.9 water-column uptake bias\n2. `root_rosette.toml` - RootFeedingRosette guild, 0.6 growth rate, 0.9 substrate uptake bias\n\n**Shrimp (1):**\n1. `neocaridina_davidi.toml` - Optimal 22-26°C, GH 5-10°D, 0.15 spawn rate, 21-day eggs, 0.7 hatch success, thermal penalty starts at 28°C (full at 33°C)\n\n**Process Params (1):**\n1. `default.toml` - Comprehensive kinetic parameters for decomposers, AOB, NOB, comammox, plants, algae, shrimp dynamics, microfauna\n\n---\n\n### 8. CRATE DEPENDENCY STRUCTURE\n\n```\ntank-simulation/ (workspace)\n├── tank_core (primary simulation engine)\n│   ├── Dependencies: serde, thiserror\n│   ├── Exports: Engine, SimulationEngine, TankSnapshot, PlayerAction, SimEvent, etc.\n│   └── Tests: determinism, save/load, water_change, tank_size, temperature, cycling, events, etc.\n├── tank_data (preset management)\n│   ├── Dependencies: serde, thiserror\n│   ├── Exports: Preset types, loading functions\n│   └── Data: TOML files for scenarios, substrates, plants, source water, shrimp, process params\n├── tank_scenarios (scenario materialization)\n│   ├── Dependencies: tank_core, tank_data\n│   ├── Exports: seeded_state(), cycling_fixture_pair(), default_scenario_ids(), load_named_scenario()\n│   └── Tests: Materialization tests\n└── tank_tui (terminal user interface - minimal)\n    ├── Dependencies: crossterm, ratatui, tank_core\n    ├── Exports: Screen enum, TuiApp struct\n    └── Status: Basic structure only, no rendering or event handling\n```\n\n---\n\n### SUMMARY\n\nThe tank-simulation project has:\n\n**Fully Implemented:**\n- tank_core: Complete simulation engine with all systems, types, and validation\n- tank_data: All preset files loaded and validated at compile time\n- tank_scenarios: Scenario materialization and fixture pair generation\n- 10 mandatory acceptance tests + 40+ additional validation tests\n- Comprehensive TankSnapshot with 42 fields\n- 12 PlayerAction types with full validation\n- 13 EventKind types with 17 EventCause codes\n\n**Minimal/Incomplete:**\n- tank_tui: Basic data structures only, no UI implementation, no rendering, no event handling\n\nAll core functionality is production-ready and thoroughly tested. The TUI needs implementation."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ae03ba0ed064acd21 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 86890\ntool_uses: 44\nduration_ms: 77971</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1c400ec2-d2a3-480f-a778-7947b0a4715b","uuid":"ccdf93b4-ec06-4183-accf-1667dbc9afa0","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the tank-simulation project to understand:\n\n1. What exists in the `tank_tui` crate currently? Check src files, Cargo.toml, any existing screens or widgets.\n2. What exists in the `tank_scenarios` crate currently? Check for scenario fixtures, TOML files.\n3. What acceptance tests already exist? Look for the 10 mandatory tests listed in the prompt (determinism_same_seed, save_load_resume, water_change_mass_balance, tank_size_response, ambient_temperature_action, cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded, overfeeding_effects, rooted_substrate_advantage, thermal_reproduction_penalty, event_generation).\n4. What does `TankSnapshot` look like currently? What fields does it expose?\n5. What `PlayerAction` variants are implemented?\n6. What event kinds exist?\n7. What TOML preset files exist in tank_data?\n8. What scenarios exist?\n\nBe very thorough - check all crates, all test files, all data directories.","agentId":"ae03ba0ed064acd21","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have a complete picture. Let me create a comprehensive summary report:\n\n## Comprehensive Tank-Simulation Project Exploration Report\n\n### 1. TANK_TUI CRATE\n\n**Current Status:** Minimal implementation with basic structure in place.\n\n**Source Files:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_tui/src/lib.rs` (36 lines)\n\n**What Exists:**\n- `Screen` enum with 5 screens: `Overview`, `Chemistry`, `Biology`, `Actions`, `Log`\n- `TuiApp` struct with:\n  - `active_screen: Screen`\n  - `snapshot: TankSnapshot`\n  - `pending_actions: Vec<PlayerAction>`\n  - Methods: `new()`, `queue_action()`, `update_snapshot()`\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- `crossterm` (0.27) - Terminal control\n- `ratatui` (0.26) - TUI framework\n- `tank_core` - Local crate dependency\n\n**What's Missing:**\n- No actual screen rendering implementations\n- No event handlers or input processing\n- No widgets or UI layout logic\n- No main binary or entry point\n\n---\n\n### 2. TANK_SCENARIOS CRATE\n\n**Current Status:** Functional with scenario materialization and fixture pair generation.\n\n**Source Files:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` (352 lines)\n\n**What Exists:**\n\n**Public Functions:**\n1. `default_scenario_ids()` - Returns `&['nano_cycle', 'medium_planted', 'warm_room']`\n2. `load_named_scenario(id)` - Loads ScenarioPreset from tank_data\n3. `seeded_state(seed, scenario_id)` - Materializes a fully resolved TankState from scenario preset\n4. `cycling_fixture_pair(seed)` - Creates paired seeded/unseeded fixture states for nitrogen cycling tests\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Converts tank_data presets into tank_core types\n- Populates source-water catalog with all known presets\n- Handles substrate layer creation and initialization\n- Initializes plant guilds from presets\n- Sets up environment state from scenario\n- Creates deterministic cycling fixtures with different initial microbe states\n\n**Test File:**\n- `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/tests/materialization.rs` (147 lines)\n\n**Test Coverage:**\n1. `nano_cycle_materializes_correctly` - Geometry, volume, metadata, water catalog, substrate, plants\n2. `medium_planted_materializes_with_two_substrates_and_plants` - Multi-substrate/plant scenarios\n3. `warm_room_materializes_with_high_ambient` - High-ambient scenario\n4. `deterministic_materialization` - Same seed produces identical states\n5. `unknown_scenario_returns_error` - Error handling\n6. `cycling_fixtures_are_deterministic_and_differ_in_seeding` - Fixture pair validation\n\n---\n\n### 3. ACCEPTANCE TESTS INVENTORY\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/tests/`\n\n**Test Files and Coverage:**\n\n#### determinism.rs (16 lines)\n- `determinism_basic` - Two engines with same seed produce identical snapshots and states\n\n#### save_load.rs (156 lines)\n- `save_load_roundtrip` - SaveFile serialization/deserialization with actions\n- `save_load_with_source_water_catalog` - Source water catalog preservation\n- **save_load_resume_determinism** - MANDATORY: Save after 240h, load, run 480h = uninterrupted 720h\n- `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` - Active nitrogen cycle state preservation\n\n#### water_change_mass_balance.rs (323 lines)\n- **water_change_50_percent_ro_like_halves_dissolved_totals** - MANDATORY: 50% water change halves all dissolved totals (±0.5%)\n- `water_change_0_percent_is_noop` - 0% change no-op verification\n- `water_change_100_percent_yields_source_temperature` - 100% change results in source temperature\n- `water_change_50_percent_mixes_temperature` - Temperature mixing verification\n- `unknown_source_profile_returns_error` - Error handling for unknown profiles\n- `unknown_profile_leaves_state_unchanged` - Rollback on error\n- `invalid_resolved_profile_returns_error_and_leaves_state_unchanged` - Corruption detection\n- `invalid_resolved_profile_negative_chemistry_returns_error` - Negative chemistry validation\n\n#### tank_size_thermal_response.rs (198 lines)\n- **smaller_tank_responds_faster_to_ambient_change** - MANDATORY: 10L reaches half-delta in fewer than half the ticks of 100L\n- `lid_slows_surface_heat_exchange` - Lid effect on heat exchange\n- `feed_pulse_tan_concentration_scales_with_volume` - TAN concentration inversely proportional to volume\n\n#### ambient_temperature_action.rs (142 lines)\n- **ambient_change_causes_gradual_warming** - MANDATORY: Ambient change doesn't instantly transfer to water\n- `do_saturation_decreases_with_warming` - DO saturation decreases with temperature\n- `heater_output_zero_when_above_setpoint` - Heater control logic\n- `heater_never_cools_tank` - Heater never outputs below setpoint\n- `heater_fires_when_below_setpoint` - Heater fires when needed\n\n#### cycling.rs (374 lines)\n- **cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded** - MANDATORY: Seeded tank cycles faster and reaches stable state earlier\n- `filter_cleaning_setback` - CleanFilter action reduces nitrifier biomass\n- `limiter_correctness_no_negative_pools` - Extreme stress test for negative pool prevention\n- `limiter_shared_do_budget` - DO budget enforcement for nitrification\n- `limiter_low_alkalinity_caps_nitrification` - Alkalinity budget enforcement\n- `dirty_filter_slows_nitrification` - Clogged filter reduces nitrification rate\n- `siphon_detritus_reduces_cycling_pressure` - SiphonDetritus action reduces detritus accumulation\n\n#### rooted_substrate_advantage.rs (82 lines)\n- **rooted_substrate_advantage** - MANDATORY: Root-feeding rosette on active_planted substrate grows ≥15% more than on inert_sand\n\n#### thermal_reproduction_penalty.rs (125 lines)\n- **thermal_reproduction_penalty** - MANDATORY: 30°C tank shows ≥20% lower reproductive readiness after 60 days, fewer juveniles\n\n#### events.rs (273 lines)\n- **event_generation_warm_overfed_weak_aeration** - MANDATORY: Warm, overfed, weak-aeration setup emits AmmoniaWarning or OxygenDip\n- `threshold_events_emit_with_cause_codes` - Events include cause codes\n- `threshold_events_are_deduplicated_per_day` - Daily deduplication\n- `shrimp_berried_event_has_cause_codes` - ShrimpBerried events have cause codes\n- `egg_failure_event_has_cause_codes` - EggFailure events have cause codes\n- `molt_stress_warning_has_cause_codes` - MoltStressWarning events have cause codes\n\n**Mandatory Tests Found: 10/10**\n1. ✓ determinism_same_seed → `determinism_basic`\n2. ✓ save_load_resume → `save_load_resume_determinism`\n3. ✓ water_change_mass_balance → `water_change_50_percent_ro_like_halves_dissolved_totals`\n4. ✓ tank_size_response → `smaller_tank_responds_faster_to_ambient_change`\n5. ✓ ambient_temperature_action → `ambient_change_causes_gradual_warming`\n6. ✓ cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded → `cycling_seeded_vs_unseeded`\n7. ✓ overfeeding_effects → `event_generation_warm_overfed_weak_aeration`\n8. ✓ rooted_substrate_advantage → `rooted_substrate_advantage`\n9. ✓ thermal_reproduction_penalty → `thermal_reproduction_penalty`\n10. ✓ event_generation → `threshold_events_emit_with_cause_codes` + others\n\n---\n\n### 4. TANKSNAPSHOT STRUCTURE\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` (129 lines)\n\n**Fields Exposed (42 total):**\n\nTime:\n- `day: u32`\n- `hour: u8`\n\nWater Chemistry:\n- `water_temp_c: f64`\n- `water_volume_l: f64`\n- `tan_mg_l: f64` (total ammonia nitrogen per liter)\n- `nh3_mg_l: f64` (unionized ammonia)\n- `nitrite_mg_l: f64`\n- `nitrate_mg_l: f64`\n- `phosphate_mg_l: f64`\n- `do_mg_l: f64` (dissolved oxygen)\n- `do_sat_mg_l: f64` (DO saturation at current temp)\n- `gh_d: f64` (general hardness in dGH)\n- `kh_d: f64` (carbonate hardness in dKH)\n- `tds_mg_l: f64` (total dissolved solids)\n- `conductivity_us_cm: f64`\n- `ph: f64`\n\nAnimal Populations:\n- `adult_shrimp_count: u32`\n- `juveniles_count: u32`\n- `berried_females_count: u32`\n\nAnimal Condition:\n- `shrimp_condition_index: f64`\n- `shrimp_molt_stress_index: f64`\n- `shrimp_reproductive_readiness: f64`\n\nBiology:\n- `microfauna_population_index: f64`\n- `microfauna_grazing_pressure_index: f64`\n- `total_plant_biomass_g: f64`\n- `fast_stem_biomass_g: f64`\n- `root_feeding_rosette_biomass_g: f64`\n- `suspended_algae_biomass_g: f64`\n- `periphyton_biomass_g: f64`\n- `algae_nuisance_index: f64`\n\nSubstrate:\n- `substrate_nutrient_remaining_mg_n_total: f64`\n- `substrate_nutrient_remaining_mg_p_total: f64`\n\nHardware:\n- `last_heater_output_w: f64`\n\nEvents:\n- `recent_events: Vec<SimEvent>` (last 20 events, reversed)\n\n---\n\n### 5. PLAYERACTION VARIANTS\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` (180 lines)\n\n**Implemented Variants (11 total):**\n\n1. **Feed** `{ grams: f64 }`\n2. **WaterChangePercent** `{ percent: f64, source_profile_id: String }`\n3. **TrimPlants** `{ fraction: f64 }`\n4. **SiphonDetritus** `{ fraction: f64 }`\n5. **CleanFilter** `{ intensity: f64 }`\n6. **AddShrimp** `{ count: u32 }`\n7. **RemoveShrimp** `{ count: u32 }`\n8. **ChangePhotoperiod** `{ hours: f64 }`\n9. **ChangeLightIntensity** `{ intensity_index: f64 }`\n10. **ChangeHeaterSetpoint** `{ setpoint_c: f64 }`\n11. **ChangeAmbientTemperature** `{ target_c: f64 }`\n12. **ChangeAeration** `{ enabled: bool, intensity: f64 }`\n\n**Validation Implemented:**\n- Non-negative (Feed, grams)\n- Percent range (0-100)\n- Fraction range (0-1)\n- Hours range (0-24)\n- Temperature > 0°C\n- Finite values\n- Non-empty source_profile_id\n- Shrimp removal doesn't exceed available\n\n---\n\n### 6. EVENT KINDS\n\n**File:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/events.rs` (78 lines)\n\n**EventKind Enum (13 variants):**\n1. `CycleProgressing`\n2. `AmmoniaWarning`\n3. `NitriteWarning`\n4. `OxygenDip`\n5. `AlgaeRiskRising`\n6. `AlgaeBloom`\n7. `BiofilmMaturityIncrease`\n8. `ShrimpBerried`\n9. `EggFailure`\n10. `MoltStressWarning`\n11. `FilterCleaningSetback`\n12. `SubstrateFoulingWarning`\n13. `StabilityImproving`\n\n**EventCause Enum (17 variants):**\n- `RoutineAction`, `Overfeeding`, `WaterChange`, `FilterMaintenance`\n- `HighAmmonia`, `HighNitrite`, `LowOxygen`, `HighTemperature`, `LowMinerals`\n- `BiofilterImmature`, `SurfaceExchangeRestricted`, `HighNutrients`, `PlantCrowding`\n- `SurfaceSaturation`, `SubstrateExhausted`, `ChemistryInstability`, `Starvation`, `PoorCondition`\n\n**EventSeverity Enum (3 variants):**\n- `Info`, `Warning`, `Critical`\n\n**SimEvent Structure:**\n- `day: u32`, `hour: u8`\n- `severity: EventSeverity`\n- `kind: EventKind`\n- `cause_codes: Vec<EventCause>`\n- `summary: String`\n\n---\n\n### 7. TOML PRESET FILES\n\n**Location:** `/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/`\n\n**Scenarios (3):**\n1. `nano_cycle.toml` - 30×20cm, 10.8L, 24°C ambient, soft_acidic water, inert_sand, fast_stem\n2. `medium_planted.toml` - 60×30cm, ~57.6L, 24°C ambient, moderate water, active_planted + coarse_porous, fast_stem + root_rosette\n3. `warm_room.toml` - 45×24cm, ~25.9L, 29°C ambient, moderate water, inert_gravel, fast_stem\n\n**Source Water (4):**\n1. `soft_acidic.toml` - 23°C, GH ~3.0, KH ~1.5, TDS ~90, DIC 6.0 mg/L\n2. `moderate.toml` - 24°C, GH ~6.0, KH ~3.5, TDS ~160, DIC 15.0 mg/L, 5 mg/L NO3\n3. `hard_shrimp.toml` - 23°C, GH ~9.3, KH ~5.0, TDS ~220, DIC 21.0 mg/L, 8 mg/L NO3\n4. `ro_like.toml` - 23°C, All zeros (pure deionized for regression tests)\n\n**Substrates (4):**\n1. `inert_sand.toml` - 3cm depth, CEC 0.1, no nutrient charge, low detritus trapping\n2. `inert_gravel.toml` - 4cm depth, CEC 0.1, no nutrient charge, very low detritus trapping\n3. `active_planted.toml` - 5cm depth, CEC 0.9, 60mg N + 18mg P nutrients, high detritus trapping\n4. `coarse_porous.toml` - 4cm depth, CEC 0.3, 10mg N + 3mg P nutrients, very high detritus trapping\n\n**Plants (2):**\n1. `fast_stem.toml` - FastStem guild, 0.9 growth rate, 0.9 water-column uptake bias\n2. `root_rosette.toml` - RootFeedingRosette guild, 0.6 growth rate, 0.9 substrate uptake bias\n\n**Shrimp (1):**\n1. `neocaridina_davidi.toml` - Optimal 22-26°C, GH 5-10°D, 0.15 spawn rate, 21-day eggs, 0.7 hatch success, thermal penalty starts at 28°C (full at 33°C)\n\n**Process Params (1):**\n1. `default.toml` - Comprehensive kinetic parameters for decomposers, AOB, NOB, comammox, plants, algae, shrimp dynamics, microfauna\n\n---\n\n### 8. CRATE DEPENDENCY STRUCTURE\n\n```\ntank-simulation/ (workspace)\n├── tank_core (primary simulation engine)\n│   ├── Dependencies: serde, thiserror\n│   ├── Exports: Engine, SimulationEngine, TankSnapshot, PlayerAction, SimEvent, etc.\n│   └── Tests: determinism, save/load, water_change, tank_size, temperature, cycling, events, etc.\n├── tank_data (preset management)\n│   ├── Dependencies: serde, thiserror\n│   ├── Exports: Preset types, loading functions\n│   └── Data: TOML files for scenarios, substrates, plants, source water, shrimp, process params\n├── tank_scenarios (scenario materialization)\n│   ├── Dependencies: tank_core, tank_data\n│   ├── Exports: seeded_state(), cycling_fixture_pair(), default_scenario_ids(), load_named_scenario()\n│   └── Tests: Materialization tests\n└── tank_tui (terminal user interface - minimal)\n    ├── Dependencies: crossterm, ratatui, tank_core\n    ├── Exports: Screen enum, TuiApp struct\n    └── Status: Basic structure only, no rendering or event handling\n```\n\n---\n\n### SUMMARY\n\nThe tank-simulation project has:\n\n**Fully Implemented:**\n- tank_core: Complete simulation engine with all systems, types, and validation\n- tank_data: All preset files loaded and validated at compile time\n- tank_scenarios: Scenario materialization and fixture pair generation\n- 10 mandatory acceptance tests + 40+ additional validation tests\n- Comprehensive TankSnapshot with 42 fields\n- 12 PlayerAction types with full validation\n- 13 EventKind types with 17 EventCause codes\n\n**Minimal/Incomplete:**\n- tank_tui: Basic data structures only, no UI implementation, no rendering, no event handling\n\nAll core functionality is production-ready and thoroughly tested. The TUI needs implementation."}],"totalDurationMs":77971,"totalTokens":86890,"totalToolUseCount":44,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":547,"cache_read_input_tokens":81609,"output_tokens":4734,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":547},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
